     A ticked tile also says so on the picture itself. */
  .press-pick--tile { position: absolute; top: 8px; left: 8px; z-index: 3; padding: 7px; background: rgba(244, 241, 233, .92); opacity: 0; transition: opacity .25s var(--ease); }
