  /* ── TOUCH ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  /* Under a finger the drawn sizes stay and the hit area grows to 44 px around each control. The
     summary takes `::before`, because its `::after` is the + that turns. A tile's box is already
     positioned, so only a row's box needs a containing block. */
  @media (pointer: coarse) {
